      "path": "docs/before-workflow/TESTING.md",
      "line": 43,
      "kinds": [
        "protocol_capture_audit"
      ],
      "text": "wn server limits remain explicit: WsgiDAV uses nonstandard DAV:name for propname and returns malformed href-only 207 for the standard request; the test expects protocol rejection and a separate fixture verifies standard propname. Its fresh HEAD 401 has an illegal body under Cheroot; live authentication uses GET, warmed HEAD is covered, and a conforming HEAD challenge is checked in a fixture. Its bare Lock-Token header is normalized after URI validation and matched against the XML body. Shared-lock writes supply both same-user tokens. These are not silently counted as full standards compatibility.",
